# What the image build context leaves out (P1.27): history, local installs and builds (each stage installs and
# builds its own), tests, docs and secrets. The runtime stage copies named folders only; this keeps the rest out of
# the build stages too.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
.worktrees
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
tests
docs
.env
.env.*
secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
